{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23761","headline":"和刘郎中学士题集贤阁 · 白居易","name":"和刘郎中学士题集贤阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱阁青山高庳齐，与君才子作诗题。\n傍闻大内笙歌近，下视诸司屋舍低。\n万卷图书天禄上，一条风景月华西。\n欲知丞相优贤意，百步新廊不蹋泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}